<title>PHILIPPINES: Bacnotan 9-mt net at 343 million pesos.</title>
<headline>Bacnotan 9-mt net at 343 million pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to March 31.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	  8.12 vs 5.99</p>
<p>    Net income		    343  vs 331</p>
<p>Note - The company's full name is Bacnotan Consolidated Industries Inc. It is the holding company of several cement firms.</p>
